questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a batch processing Spring Boot service crashes with `java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space` after processing several thousand records. The service consumes a streaming source and processes each record inside a transaction as shown below:

java
@Service
public class IngestionService {
    @PersistenceContext
    private EntityManager entityManager;

    @Transactional
    public void processBatch(Stream<DataRecord> recordStream) {
        recordStream.forEach(record -> {
            AuditLog log = new AuditLog(record.getId(), record.getPayload());
            entityManager.persist(log);
            if (record.getIndex() % 500 == 0) {
                entityManager.flush();
            }
        });
    }
}
